Description: Asymptotic covariance matrix of the half-vectorization of the
    sample covariance matrix without a distributional assumption
    (asymptotic distribution free): the consistent estimator and its
    unbiased version.
    The functions are internal; other projects copy them.
URL: https://github.com/ijapesigan/gammaADF,
